    description: Some("Enemy airships bear down on your command base, and a five-ship squadron flying in formation is all that stands between them and annihilation. Every ship still alive fires one missile per salvo, so losing them thins your firepower — and the only way to rebuild is to shoot down ten enemies, then thread a replacement into a vacant slot in the formation."),
